   "binniecore.ponder.laboratory_machine.header": "Mounting databases on the Lab Stand",
   "binniecore.ponder.laboratory_machine.text_1": "The Lab Stand is not a processing machine. It is a physical home for Binnie's genetic knowledge databases, keeping frequently used reference tools in the laboratory world.",
   "binniecore.ponder.laboratory_machine.text_2": "Right-click the placed stand with a compatible database to mount it. The mounted item is rendered on the stand instead of disappearing into an invisible inventory.",
